          hint: 'Combine sigma and the distance to target as the root of their summed squares, then divide the tolerance by six times that.',
          why: '0.009² + 0.012² = 0.000081 + 0.000144 = 0.000225; √ = 0.015; 6 × 0.015 = 0.090; 0.080 / 0.090 = 0.89.',
